# Tests

The suite fails if a published post is missing a title, description, or date, or if a draft is listed.

Cover:

- published posts newest first
- drafts hidden
- https-only external links

Playwright covers the homepage, the blog index, and one post on desktop and mobile.

Test behavior. Do not assert CSS classes or generated ids. Do not weaken a published-post test to make it pass.
